nce/Sources sheets; allocation_audit.json.","transfer_assumption":"Assumed composition is fixed across 1950–2019 and landings, total catch and discards; source model is a 2000s northern shelf representation."},{"taxon":"Miscellaneous aquatic invertebrates","reason":"Groups 5–12 form an explicit approximation to the saved demersal-invertebrate reporting class. The broader raw aquatic-invertebrate label does not verify that pelagic invertebrates are absent, so exclusion of jellyfish and caught zooplankton remains uncertain. Model catch proportions provide the split; allocation confidence remains Medium.","transfer_assumption":"Assumed composition is fixed across 1950–2019 and landings, total catch and discards; source model is a 2000s northern shelf representation."},{"taxon":"Perciformes","reason":"The adopted named and residual percoid-compatible fish pools are a broad reporting-era approximation. Perciformes has changed taxonomic scope, and the raw label provides no family composition with which to validate every included or excluded model group. Model catch proportions provide the split; allocation confidence remains Medium.","transfer_assumption":"Assumed composition is fixed across 1950–2019 and landings, total catch and discards; source model is a 2000s northern shelf representation."}],"review_table_schema":["model_id","taxon","membership_rule","membership_confidence","allocation_rule","allocation_confidence","overall_confidence","membership_evidence","allocation_evidence","candidate_selection","allocation_calculation","reason","adoption_date","review_run_id","assumption_dependent"],"allocation_ledger_schema":["unit_id","model_id","taxon","rule","confidence","weight_evidence","definition","evidence","limitations","source_period","online_search","previous_mapping","years_applied","catch_bases_applied","rule_details","source_catch_basis","temporal_and_basis_assumption","group","seq","source_catch","weight","source_definition","numeric_sppr_exists","review_confid